DOAO6SJc8AAAABP53MNA","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T21:49:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T21:49:15Z","body":"This is because some compression modes (when Godot import the image) don't play well with `D3D12` if the image has a width/height small than 4. The `nes-aesprite-1x.png` trigger this error because use a 56x1 dimension.\n\n```\nD3D12 ERROR: ID3D12Device::GetResourceAllocationInfo: Textures created with certain Formats must align the resource dimensions properly. D3D12_RESOURCE_DESC::Format is BC1_TYPELESS. D3D12_RESOURCE_DESC::Width is 56, and must be a multiple of 4. D3D12_RESOURCE_DESC::Height is 1, and must be a multiple of 4. [ STATE_CREATION ERROR #597: CREATERESOURCE_INVALIDDIMENSIONS]\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5362273332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]